  "reason": "The quadratic multiradical-square warm/cloned rows are faster in all five blocks with median paired ratios 0.908674/0.936436, alongside nine other all-five faster rows. All allocation, retained and peak fields are identical. These observations warrant native testing, while the all-five conjugate-then-affine warm slowdown and five additional four-block slower rows remain open.",
